From: YeonGyu-Kim <code.yeon.gyu@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 7 Apr 2026 15:24:02 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 4005/5749] fix: prevent background agent race condition in
 session prompt (#2932)

Added await for session ready state before sending prompt in
background-agent/manager.ts. Also improved image resizer error handling.

132 tests pass, tsc clean.

Closes #2932
